  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "Comment",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -110,
      "params": {
        "text": "Lost-city rumor (spec/systems/exploration.md), rebuilt. Outcome = Roll(1,9); Hernando de Soto (ff.7) remaps a bad roll (5/6/8) to 3 (ruins) -- one Formula. A Seasoned Scout (UnitIsSeasonedScout of the entering unit) adds +2 to the treasure tier. Treasure amounts (Cibola, ruins, friendly-tribe gift) are each one Formula. Switch routes the 9 outcomes incl. the Fountain of Youth (8 immigrants)."
      }
    },
